'''Clan of the Maniacs''' (大乱闘狂乱ファミリーズ ''Dai Rantō Kyōran Famirīzu'', '''Big Brawl Frenzied Families''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]] and appears on the 1st day of every month. It is unlocked after clearing every [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stage]] (excluding [[Crazed Moneko]]). The 1st stage drops 1 [[Cat Capsule|Rare Ticket]] when cleared for the first time, while the 2nd stage drops 2 Rare Tickets on first clear and awards the player with the Frenzied Family [[Meow Medals|Meow Medal]].

