==Trivia==
*Clan of the Maniacs' Japanese name, Big Brawl Frenzied Families (大乱闘狂乱ファミリーズ ''Dai Rantō Kyōran Famirīzu''), may be a reference to ''Big Brawl Smash Brothers'' (大乱闘スマッシュブラザーズ ''Dai Rantō Sumasshu Burazāzu''), the Japanese name of [[wikipedia:Super Smash Bros.|''Super Smash Bros.'']]

